# Keep the image clean and avoid clobbering the `npm ci` install with the host's
# node_modules (which may contain platform-mismatched native binaries).
#
# `**/` and not a bare `node_modules`: a bare pattern anchors to the build
# context root, so a nested `server/server/node_modules` was copied into the
# image wholesale by `COPY . .`. The nested package that made that possible is
# gone, but the anchoring is the actual defect and it outlives that one folder.
**/node_modules
npm-debug.log
.env
.env.*
*.log
fly.toml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
README.md
